                <pb facs="1015" n="911" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg911"/>

                <head>The Chihuahua Newspaper “El Nuevo Mundo.”</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Summary.</hi>—The American Chargé d’Affaires on
                    December 15 reported request of the Spanish Minister for the good offices of
                    this Government to prevent seizure of the establishment in Chihuahua of “El
                    Nuevo Mundo,” of which Villa had taken the keys. The Department instructed the
                    Consul at that point to extend all proper and possible protection to this
                    property. (File Nos. 312.52/67, 80.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
